{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30016_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:112cc1b404de830899f7e78e3facc3154e6ce9f1195db2f5d04c26e8781019ef",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea1ad976ae83e31b6dcd2d8efe0f0f43440b552a9c615ab4a364354802635705",
      "text": "是前阵子工作去过的地方吧。还有事务所，\n这个是最近在看的书吧？剩下的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ac5cc4c6853098426284216ff0c399c1b01250f5c88bfecc16860bd8580b33a",
      "text": "……！这个攀爬架，\n是我们第一次见面的公园……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3962cee9ce282210e87604f6ee2c77b1157dab369ef13cc528eb166dda9247d",
      "text": "这里，是中华街吧。\n还有前几天一起去过的店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58a4fb703d8e8b0cfb5bbc7dba133e5fa3070c23c4d96a834e9a361c4031de69",
      "text": "我本来想拍没有其他人入镜的照片，\n但时机一直很难抓。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eb32b5b6401eb9d4654ac835b0953b15f3b085c3eeb663be51e82b49d99a8a7",
      "text": "时机……那么，你之前说的\n“很难”难道是指。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7f26562730d73bd96b282c00d3b7a4faeb8fd5ae60cc9e1319cfe32058ba682",
      "text": "啊啊。公园也好中华街也好，人流量都很大。\n一直拍不到满意的照片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61b9a8f7cb823724c306e262a93c5781727bd92c740831d28d95aec457a272e1",
      "text": "原、原来是这么回事啊……！我还\n以为肯定是因为拍不了家人的照片才……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0df6197897cc7a0452fcd286599ee855d64a7e93fbef46a502aeac670bc7810a",
      "text": "呵，这样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6cd48fe0a75b435f6555fe406ee4f6236ef74a8e400653bf5e5fda0fdc86f9b",
      "text": "让你替我操心了啊。抱歉。确实，\n我从来没有详细跟你提过家里的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01a9500572c9994ef2871f5fd1c3d9e83099d038c23f557e12522666b0c79f9f",
      "text": "玄武……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9af0cd34254d3ec6e340fa1ccac65cb596e7b79216654e1fe1ee7bd8d379ef9",
      "text": "趁这个机会，不妨听听我的故事吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1917cbb60ac6b78bc1dd61a20707c17acbf5ee9d5963cbf03a671e9f921ecf45",
      "text": "以前稍微提过，我受亡父的一位老朋友\n照顾。那个人是个律师。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:117b4ece2b2b1a40c309b630af8d79098a3f6bc304c67016bb86de484287e6a0",
      "text": "他总是在世界各地奔波，虽然不怎么见得上面，\n但对我很好。……我很感激他。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba968d0b4ae6a8104be11d2f251cf1aefe5f22a9e39ade7660bfbf6055715865",
      "text": "然后是我长大的福利院，那是个好地方。\n只不过距离太远，没办法经常回去就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40ae06140b36bae1d630b6d29248f38442745134c131bd9dbb0cd669d6656237",
      "text": "……嘛，虽说经历了很多事，\n最后没办法继续待在那边了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d872af56f2775a21ef55bfd6afb328d4047557e212dbc0f8c5c179bb5e8780f9",
      "text": "但多亏了那样，我才遇到了你。接着遇到了番长，\n才得以做起了偶像这种行当。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
